---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="Free Honey | The Soul Mami" description="Free tools for self-connection from Eliana, the Soul Mami: journaling prompts, practices, and resources. Take what you need.">

  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="wrap prose center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Free · Always</span>
      <h1>Free honey from the <em class="soul">hive</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Tools for self-connection, free for the taking. Start
        anywhere. Take what you need, share what helps, come back for
        more.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap grid-3 honey-grid">
      <!-- TODO: swap the "Coming soon" cards for Eliana's real freebies (PDFs, downloads, links) as they're ready -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="sprout" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>Letters from the garden</h3>
        <p>The first goodie is the ongoing one: journal entries, new tools, and first word on everything, straight to your inbox.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="/garden/">Join free &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="pencil" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>Journaling prompts to meet yourself</h3>
        <p>A starter set of the kinds of prompts we use in the Journaling Hive, for the mornings you want to go deeper than "today I…".</p>
        <span class="tag">Coming soon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="headphones" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>The songs</h3>
        <p>My music is a free tool too. Three songs live now. Press play while you write.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="/work-with-me/music/">Listen now &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="notes" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>The Dance Heals playlist</h3>
        <p>My own Spotify playlist for moving your body. Put it on, shake out the week, and let the feelings move through you.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="https://spoti.fi/2Wi4tnE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Press play &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="podcast" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>Podcast conversations</h3>
        <p>Me, talking soul on other people's mics. Start with the latest, on what self care actually demands, or go back to <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/00wc0NM5Tpdv3kKIdUvJpS" target="_blank" rel="noopener">my 2022 interview</a>.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/2KUt4qjkDIiP5ZF2GPgxay" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Listen to the latest &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="play" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>My YouTube channel</h3>
        <!-- TODO: add a TEDx talk card once Eliana's talk is public and she sends the link -->
        <p>Life, soul, and everything in between, on video. Pull up a chair and stay a while. My songs have <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@thesoulmamimusic" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their own channel</a> too.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="https://www.youtube.com/@theSoulMami" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="books" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>The books</h3>
        <!-- TODO: second book title and link from Eliana -->
        <p>Two books so far, more life to write about. Start with Mind Your Business.</p>
        <a class="tag tag--live" href="https://amzn.to/2P3bhlA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get the book &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon"><Icon name="candle" size={28} /></div>
        <h3>An emotional first-aid practice</h3>
        <p>What I actually do when a big feeling hits: the alchemist's short version, written down for you.</p>
        <span class="tag">Coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="center muted" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
      More goodies get added over time. That's the whole point of the doors. Keep coming back.
    </p>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); }
  /* Eight cards: three per row, with the last two centered under the rest. */
  .honey-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .honey-grid > * { grid-column: span 2; }
  .honey-grid > :nth-child(3n+1):nth-last-child(2) { grid-column: 2 / span 2; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .honey-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .honey-grid > *,
    .honey-grid > :nth-child(3n+1):nth-last-child(2) { grid-column: auto; }
  }
  .icon {
    color: var(--bark);
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: var(--sand);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--stone);
    background: var(--sand);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tag--live { background: var(--gold-soft); color: var(--espresso); }
  .tag--live:hover { background: var(--amber); color: var(--espresso); }
</style>
